1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:01,701
What if two
honorable people

2
00:00:01,721 --> 00:00:03,920
could consider each
other evil?

3
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:05,932
Mira walks away from
the oath she swore

4
00:00:05,952 --> 00:00:07,152
at sixteen.

5
00:00:07,172 --> 00:00:09,106
In the free towns,
that's courage.

6
00:00:09,126 --> 00:00:10,816
No one should own
your life.

7
00:00:10,836 --> 00:00:12,904
In the valley league,
it's betrayal.

8
00:00:12,924 --> 00:00:14,192
The levee she
guarded keeps

9
00:00:14,212 --> 00:00:15,805
everyone alive.

10
00:00:15,825 --> 00:00:17,802
Each side calls the
other heartless.

11
00:00:17,822 --> 00:00:19,921
Both are right about
something.

12
00:00:19,941 --> 00:00:21,877
Give both sides real
reasons,

13
00:00:21,897 --> 00:00:24,341
and let neither be
entirely right.

14
00:00:24,361 --> 00:00:26,675
Which matters more:
personal freedom,

15
00:00:26,695 --> 00:00:28,850
or collective
responsibility?
